WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.660
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.780
I'm busy!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.790
Begone!

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:25.480
A lowly <i>yokai</i> dares speak to me like that?

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.740
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.170
Somebody!

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.020
Is anybody here?!

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.860
Dammit! How could this happen?

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:20.840
Saya!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:26.120
Rei... My brother...

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.710
That's right! What happened?

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.100
A <i>yokai</i>...

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:36.130
It said... "How dare... the Kidoshu..."

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:41.140
Our master protected me, but...

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.780
everyone...

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.910
It's so dark...

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:49.500
Are you still there...?

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.130
I'm here! I'm right here, Saya!

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.160
Saya? Saya!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.640
CHAPTER 51

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.670
ENMA-DAIO'S SECRET BARGAIN

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.920
How cute!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.660
Let's get along, Cat-chan!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.330
No!

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.600
Cat go home with Kitaro!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.430
No, Catchick.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.940
You need to recharge your
<i>yokai</i> power here to return to normal.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.900
No!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.460
Come on, Cat-chan.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.970
If you act like that
you'll make Kitaro-san sad.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.760
Kitaro, sad?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.580
That's right.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.080
Then Cat stay.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.160
Okay.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.610
Good girl, Catchick.

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:58.260
Please look after Catchick, Hanako-san.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.460
Sure thing.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.700
I'll be going.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.970
We should hurry.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.310
If the Nue went to the trouble of
luring us away from Tokyo,

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.190
he'll probably act right away.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.400
Yes, Dad.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.850
Okay! Express delivery!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:23.360
Huh? What is that?!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.340
A <i>yokai</i>? Dammit!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.490
I can't take this...

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.950
S-Stop...

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:30.140
That damn Nue. He went and did it.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.440
But that's a name I haven't heard in ages.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.650
I don't think he has appeared in
at least a thousand years.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:38.900
Yeah.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:45.670
Tell me, Kitaro, you've been doing nothing
but look for the Nue recently, right?

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:52.000
Catchick was annihilated by Mana's power,
even down to her soul.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.410
Normally she'd never be able to return.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:06:00.460
But, de-aged as she was,
she came back safely.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:06.320
Do your recent actions have
something to do with that?

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.200
Kitaro.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.850
I understand, Dad.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.710
Actually...

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.900
That's the Chibiki Stone.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:25.780
If you move that stone,

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:30.930
beyond it lies the Yomotsu Hirasaka,
the path to the underworld.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.390
The underworld.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.510
It's been a long time.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.560
Those who commit grave sins
during their lives are sent here.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:04.290
Here they face punishment in various hells
until their sins are absolved.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:10.200
And the one who judges the dead
if they've sinned and sentences them

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.490
is none other than Enma-Daio.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.120
However...

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:20.120
there seem to be a lot more guards
than there used to be.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:23.330
It's like they're on alert for something.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:29.490
MEZU                                  GOZU

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:33.660
It's the guards of Enma's court,
Gozu and Mezu.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.350
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.
I'm here to see Enma-Daio.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.480
Only the dead may see Enma-Daio.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.860
We are the protectors of the underworld.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.690
We cannot make another mistake again.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.820
Therefore!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.650
You must die!

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.450
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.560
Enough!

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.760
ENMA-DAIO

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.260
Enma-Daio.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.520
We meet again, Eyeball.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:24.900
Yes. There's a reason
we've crossed the Yomotsu Hirasaka.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.130
Please forgive our trespassing.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.240
And you are GeGeGe no Kitaro?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.240
That's right, Enma-Daio.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.890
We've come to ask a favor.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.330
Are you sure?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:46.040
To resurrect the dead is
to defy the laws of nature.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:48.050
Of course we're aware.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:51.340
If you grant us this favor,

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.170
I'll offer you everything I have to give.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:09:03.290
I saw you prevent the chaos by Nanashi
through my Johari Mirror.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:08.400
But, even such a deed is not enough
to allow defying nature.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.730
Go home.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.730
But...!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.700
I'm busy!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.280
Begone!

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:26.920
Do you really want me to leave?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:28.920
What?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.420
That excessive security...

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:36.030
Gozu and Mezu said they couldn't
make another mistake again.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.760
There's a problem in the underworld...

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.450
isn't there?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.420
And if there is?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.900
I'll solve it for you.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.310
K-Kitaro!

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:01.700
You'd solve our problem
without hearing what it is?

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.410
What confidence!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.980
It's not like I have confidence.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:12.210
But I'd like to think I'm aware
just how big the favor I'm asking is.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:18.570
So, no matter what your problem is,
I'll do everything I can to solve it.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.240
This is my determination.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.660
Very well. Come.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.610
What's this?

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:34.780
A prison to seal away treasonous sinners.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.910
Soon the era name of
the human world will change.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:43.280
Era names serve as spells for
spiritual protection of countries.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:47.910
They ward off disasters
and serve to pray for peace.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:51.670
And their power affects the spirit world.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:57.920
The spells protecting the underworld
become unstable around an era name change.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:02.780
There are prisoners that have
taken advantage and escaped.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.690
They are called
The Four Treasonous Generals.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.270
The Four Treasonous Generals?

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.900
They work individually.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:15.270
Each has tried to break the laws of nature
in this world and that of the living.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:21.930
These most powerful and evil <i>yokai</i>
were freed by someone's hand.

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:27.410
You want me to
capture those <i>yokai</i> for you?

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:28.870
Kitaro.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:35.420
If you swear on your life
to capture and recover their souls,

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.420
I will return Catchick immediately.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.350
But, should you fail,

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:45.430
Catchick will be brought back here.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:52.190
And your soul will forever be bound to
the underworld in the Generals' place.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.650
I don't care.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.670
If that's what it takes to
get Catchick back.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:02.780
H-How could you make such a bargain?!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.530
That explains a lot.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.890
So the Nue is one of those Generals?

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:12.750
Could you not tell Catchick and Mana?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.400
How come?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:20.400
In retrospect, what happened to them
was because of me.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:26.680
If they learn about this, I'm sure
Catchick and Mana will feel guilty.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:29.790
They can finally smile again.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.620
I never...

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.830
want to cloud those smiles again.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:42.320
Very well. We'll keep quiet for now.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.160
But, you're not
the only one at fault for that.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.680
Don't forget that.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.670
ENMA-DAIO

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:00.170
YOMI-NO-KUNI

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.070
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>
-<i>"This idiocy might be hiding a genius."</i>

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:00.070
<i>"No way."</i>

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:07.140
The fact that the Nue's voice
has no effect on sleeping people

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:11.190
shouldn't change even for the real Nue.

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:17.940
Therefore, the Nue should target a place
with lots of people awake at night again.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.690
Do you think he'll show up?

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.940
The boy calling himself Rei?

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.270
Yeah.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:27.570
Dad, just who are the Kidoshu?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:32.330
They have been hired by rulers,
temples and shrines since long ago.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:37.750
They were specialists in protecting humans
and hunting <i>yokai</i>.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:42.720
Using their own unique combination of
Onmyodo and Shugendo,

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.450
they sealed away many <i>yokai</i>.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:50.970
But, as time passed
and people stopped believing in <i>yokai</i>,

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:57.040
the darkness faded and the Kidoshu
were said to have lost their power.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.000
His power was real.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.360
Indeed.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:04.650
That and his strong hatred of <i>yokai</i>...

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.840
It's curious.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.160
Thrushes!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.730
Gather up the humans' life force!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:28.680
Once again
I shall plunge Japan into terror!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.560
That <i>chanchanko</i> and those geta...

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.270
Are you...?!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.690
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.950
So you've come. Just as I was told.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.300
Told?

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.580
NUE

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.250
He wasn't supposed to be this big.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.420
It's thanks to
consuming the humans' life force.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:10.760
I've more than satisfied my hunger
from being bound in the underworld!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:16.520
I slipped up a thousand years ago
in Kyoto, but that won't happen this time!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.270
I won't let you!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.440
I'll start with you!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.190
Hair Needles!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.500
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.440
That won't work!

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:28.070
Kitaro!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.720
Finger Guns!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.970
Pathetic! That tickles!

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.250
Internal Electricity!

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:47.250
Nice, Kitaro! It looks like the Nue is
weak to electricity!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:48.740
Don't mess with me!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:56.260
Kitaro!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.130
Who dares?!

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.360
I don't have to introduce myself to you!

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:15.620
I won't let you
lay another finger on Kitaro!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.370
Catchick...

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.330
Thank goodness! She's back to normal.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.500
I'm not sure
but this means more food for me!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.500
Go, thrushes!

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.300
What?!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.860
Kitaro!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.720
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:42.890
Dammit! It keeps following me!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.560
Good! Just a little more!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.550
What?!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.590
I told you that the Nue was mine.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.040
Rei Isurugi!

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.160
You showed up after all.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.040
Fools! You're wide open!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.370
Kitaro!

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.900
What a joke.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.760
Who are you?!

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:18.740
A lowly <i>yokai</i> dares speak to me like that?

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:28.730
It's a replica of the bow used by
Minamoto no Yorimasa who defeated you,

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.590
Raijodo.

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.440
You're weak against this sound,
aren't you?

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.200
How did you know?!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:40.620
The Kidoshu are descendants of the monks
who helped Yorimasa seal you away.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:45.140
The method of your defeat has been
passed down through the Kidoshu!

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.230
Summon <i>kijin</i>!

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:51.250
<i>ONI</i>

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:58.450
That's...

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.010
All of them!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:04.310
An arrow with
the feather of a mountain bird!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.360
Answer me.

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:19.110
Did you burn the village?!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:23.060
Th-The village?
What are you talking about?

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.840
The village of the Kidoshu!

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.540
I-I don't know!

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:35.430
If I knew such a village existed,
I would have burned it myself!

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.570
What?!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:41.660
I-I'm kidding! Make it stop!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:42.930
A miss.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.850
Fine then.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.060
Return the life force you stole.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:49.480
Do that and I'll let you go free.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.230
R-Really?!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.190
You can't! He has to go back to--

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:57.870
Shut up! I defeated him,
so he's mine to do with as I please.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:58.570
What?!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.700
Well, Nue, what'll it be?

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.680
F-Fine, I'll give it back now!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.710
You got what you wanted.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.170
Now let me go fr--

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:24.180
Idiot! I was lying!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.930
Like I'd keep a promise to a <i>yokai</i>!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.750
You're going to help feed my power!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.230
<i>On!</i>

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:36.800
The Nue's soul...!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:39.650
NUE

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:42.910
Three escaped fugitives left.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.700
Rei, was it?

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.580
Are you after
The Four Treasonous Generals, too?

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.000
How come?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:54.960
The Generals were all defeated and sent to
the underworld by my Kidoshu ancestors.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:59.470
One of them
attacked our village as revenge.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.870
The village was burned
and everyone was killed.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.660
I swore an oath while burying the dead.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:12.360
I'd get my revenge
so they could rest in peace.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.460
I'll never stop until I fulfil my vow.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:19.110
I'll defeat any <i>yokai</i> in my way.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:20.990
Without mercy!

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.320
Without hesitation!

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.420
Man, what an ordeal that was!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:38.420
I think we'd all be better off
if you'd just stayed bedridden.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:42.530
You were a lot cuter when
you were small, you know.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:48.060
Kitaro, I know we lost the Nue's soul,

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:53.150
but keep following the Four Generals and
I'm sure we'll cross paths with him again.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.400
There'll be a chance to get it back.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:21:00.280
Dad, I hate the way he does things.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:03.280
I don't want to lose next time.

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:04.840
I see.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:10.790
Oh, Kitaro, I heard you went to
Enma-Daio to get me back?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.290
Yeah, I managed to convince him.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.790
I see. Thanks.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:20.050
No need to thank me. I'm glad you're back.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:24.890
Oh, also, it sounds like
the small me said a bunch of stuff.

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:28.780
Oh yeah, ya were really honest.

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:34.120
But I don't remember what I said at all!

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:38.750
So all of you forget about it. Got it?!

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:44.930
Cat-san!

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:51.430
Welcome back!

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:59.150
I'm back, Mana.

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:05.150
<i>A young girl lives happily,
lost in a beautiful forest.</i>

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:07.700
<i>But Dad, that place is...</i>

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:10.320
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.830
<i>"Runaway Girl! The Forest of the Kinoko"</i>

00:23:12.830 --> 00:23:15.020
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
